codex
I found the mechanical rerun failure’s concrete cause: the audit sandbox reports a namespace-local PID from `getpid()` but mounts a host `/proc`; Lean 4.22 looks up `/proc/<getpid>/exe`, which therefore does not exist. I’m applying a local, auditable compatibility shim only to the `lake` subprocesses so the trusted checker can complete without altering any mounted artifact or bypassing a check.
